WHAT THIS LICENCE COVERS
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

This licence applies ONLY to the original work in this repository:

  - the transcription, structuring and organisation of course material
  - the error analysis and verification logs
  - the study guides, formula sheets and nomenclature guides
  - the redrawn SVG figures
  - the documentation and tooling

It does NOT and CANNOT cover the underlying lecture content, slide decks,
handouts, past examination papers or textbooks from which this work was
derived. Those remain the property of their respective authors, the
lecturers, and Strathmore University.

None of that material is distributed in this repository. Specifically, and
by deliberate policy:

  - no slide decks, handouts, textbooks or other source PDFs
    (see each subject's sources/SOURCES.md for what belongs where)
  - no third-party figures, textbook scans, web diagrams or stock images
  - no scans or photographs of examination papers

Where a third-party figure was removed, a caption describes what it showed.
Only figures redrawn by hand as SVG are included.

Lecturers are not named anywhere in this repository, and no staff contact
details are published. If you believe something here infringes your rights
or names you in a way you object to, open an issue and it will be removed.

