NO WARRANTY
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

This material is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. It is
student-compiled study material, not an official course resource, and it
has not been endorsed or reviewed by any lecturer or by the university.

The verification logs record errors believed to exist in the original
lecture material and give corrected forms. That analysis is offered in good
faith and has been checked, but it is not authoritative. Where a mark
depends on it, check against a standard textbook or ask your lecturer.
